  annotation (Documentation(info = "<html><body><p>Nomegestrol is a progestogen used in hormonal contraceptives and in combined progestogen–estrogen preparations, such as oral contraceptives and hormone therapy. It is an approved drug, though it appears to be used only in a limited number of countries rather than worldwide.</p><p><small>Summary written by glm-5.3-flash from <a href=&quot;https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q1722024&quot;>Wikidata Q1722024</a> and the WHO ATC classification; not checked by a person.</small></p><table><tr><td>name:</td><td>nomegestrol</td></tr><tr><td>ATC codes:</td><td>G03DB04</td></tr><tr><td>DrugBank:</td><td><a href=&quot;https://go.drugbank.com/drugs/DB11636&quot;>DB11636</a></td></tr><tr><td>PubChem CID:</td><td><a href=&quot;https://pubchem.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/compound/68783&quot;>68783</a></td></tr><tr><td>ChEBI:</td><td><a href=&quot;https://www.ebi.ac.uk/chebi/searchId.do?chebiId=CHEBI:135993&quot;>135993</a></td></tr><tr><td>Wikidata:</td><td><a href=&quot;https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q1722024&quot;>Q1722024</a></td></tr><tr><td>formula:</td><td>C21H28O3</td></tr><tr><td>molar mass:</td><td>328.452 g/mol (PubChem)</td></tr></table></body></html>"));
